# The images copy only the fat JARs, so nothing else belongs in the build context. BuildKit already transfers only
# what a COPY names, but the legacy builder sends the whole context (build/ alone is over 130 MB), and an allowlist
# keeps a later COPY from picking up anything unintended. The container tests pass their files to Testcontainers
# explicitly and do not read this file.
*
!build/libs/prometheus-proxy.jar
!build/libs/prometheus-agent.jar
